cff-version: 1.2.0
message: 'To cite package "cbssuitabilityhaiti" in publications use:'
type: dataset
license: CC-BY-4.0
title: 'cbssuitabilityhaiti: Sanitation Zoning and Water Points, Cap Haitien, Haiti
  2015-2022'
version: 0.0.1
doi: 10.5281/zenodo.8361084
abstract: 'This package contains data for a sanitation zoning assessment of Cap Haitien,
  Haiti, used for an analysis of the suitability of container-based sanitation (CBS).
  It combines two datasets: neighbourhood level zoning data from a 2022 sanitation
  zoning assessment, covering Cap Haitien and five other communes in Haiti, and the
  locations of 1849 water points in the Cap Haitien area from the mWater platform,
  added between 2015 and 2022.'
